ue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (7/10).","financial_summary":["Royalty Pharma plc is a large-cap healthcare business with a $40.7B market cap on $2.4B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +2% over the past three years, which puts it in mature, slow-growth territory.","Returns on capital run at 11% against a 8% cost of capital, which means the business barely earns its keep economically.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 5.3\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and interest coverage runs at 5.1\u00d7.","Shareholder yield of 3.9% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and stock-based comp at 12% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 6.5% of the shares, and within its sector the business captures 7.5\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 256% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 2 other valuation measures)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":2.559471577412372},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $40.9M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Carries more leverage than most Healthcare peers \u2014 a smaller cushion for the inevitable bad year","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Clinical trial concentration risk \u2014 binary FDA outcomes on a lead asset can wipe out billions in market cap in a single session.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 66% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 13% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (25.6% return)"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Liquidity Mapping Around (RPRX) Price Events","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/101/Liquidity_Mapping_Around_RPRX_Price_Events_112326073202_1795437122.html","date":"2026-11-23","timestamp":1795437122.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"RPRX vs. ILMN: Which Stock Should Value Investors Buy Now?","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3033354/rprx-vs-ilmn-which-stock-should-value-investors-buy-now?cid=CS-ZC-FT-fundamental_analysis%7Cyseop_template_3-3033354","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795189202.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.34,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Royalty Pharma PLC $RPRX Stake Increased by Voya Investment Management LLC","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/20/royalty-pharma-plc-rprx-stake-increased-by-voya-investment-management-llc.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795175209.0,"origin":"tiingo","